{"id":"castigo","lemma":"castigo","pos":"noun","rank":1711,"glosses":["punishment"],"ipa":"/kasˈtiɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"castigos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-castigo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Se merece el castigo.","en":"He deserves the punishment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524386","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to deserve","l":"merecer"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Esta vez no podremos escapar del castigo.","en":"We won't be able to escape punishment this time.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"time, instance"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to escape, get out"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Esta vez no vas a eludir tu castigo.","en":"This time, you won't avoid your punishment.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"time, instance"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to circumvent"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Ellos se escaparon de su castigo.","en":"They escaped being punished.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to escape, get out","l":"escapar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Tom se merecía el castigo que recibió.","en":"Tom deserved the punishment he got.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to deserve","l":"merecer"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"}]}]}